# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Root .gitignore — safety net across the whole monorepo.
#
# Sub-folders (bodycam_dotnet/, EO-BodyCam-AI/, deploy/) each have
# their own .gitignore for stack-specific patterns. This root file
# is a belt-and-suspenders catch-all so no secret can slip in even
# if a sub-folder ignore is edited or removed.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ── Secrets — NEVER commit these ────────────────────────────────
# .env files anywhere
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.env.local
**/.env.development
**/.env.production
# but DO allow committed templates
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.template

# appsettings.json anywhere (real one has Gemini key + DB connection)
**/appsettings.json
**/appsettings.Local.json
**/appsettings.local.json
**/appsettings.*.local.json
# allow committed templates
!**/appsettings.Example.json
!**/appsettings.json.example

# Common secret-bearing files
**/secrets.json
**/secrets.*.json
**/credentials.json
**/credentials.*.json
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.pfx
**/serviceAccount*.json
**/gcloud-key*.json
**/google-services.json

# Cloud / CI tokens that sometimes get dropped in folders
**/.aws/credentials
**/.azure/
**/.gcloud/
**/firebase-debug.log

# ── Backups & swap files ────────────────────────────────────────
*.bak
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# ── Build / dependency artifacts (so we don't accidentally bloat) ─
# Node
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.vite/

# Python
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.venv/
**/venv/

# .NET
**/bin/
**/obj/

# IDE
.vs/
.idea/
.vscode/

# Logs
**/*.log
**/logs/
